| Komponente | Was fehlt in der Doku |
|---|---|
| `AndroidManifest.xml` | `INTERNET`, `POST_NOTIFICATIONS`, `SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM`, FileProvider mit `file_paths.xml` |
